{"1387640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where Birds Sleep", "steam_appid": 1387640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/ee39763d363d114f73e61681991ceb67.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/ee39763d363d114f73e61681991ceb67.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious narrative adventure about identity, manipulation and doubt. Inhabit the mind of Cormo; a villainous, selfish pirate, as he takes on a secret mission within a prison island. See the world through the eyes of a mentally and morally unstable person. Manipulate him into doing your bidding, break him and override his will, or cooperate and work as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring real, human talent: multi-award-winning and BAFTA-nominated actor <u>Neil Newbon</u> as Cormo, along with <u>Frankie Taylor Scott</u> and <u>Ben Ayers</u>, who lend their talent and passion to the project.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/ed149737f88dda69a9a6eab051bb9d8e.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/ed149737f88dda69a9a6eab051bb9d8e.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the mind of Cormo, a rotten man driven by greed. Cormo is his own man - he’ll argue, resist and act in ways you never intended. You’re not playing as him… you’re inside his head, struggling for control. Every choice leaves a mark on his psyche. Will you guide, manipulate, tempt or break him? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/0a718ad18d8fa3167f693a45d9038789.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/0a718ad18d8fa3167f693a45d9038789.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/0a718ad18d8fa3167f693a45d9038789.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/b3b2333ffeab3eef20909bd22db3fe37.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/b3b2333ffeab3eef20909bd22db3fe37.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your influence shapes how Cormo thinks, speaks, and sees the world, altering his emotions, his sanity, his very self. Choices affect things big and small and will challenge you to see things in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/3ec0845591ed04e51436a95300a437b3.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/3ec0845591ed04e51436a95300a437b3.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/3ec0845591ed04e51436a95300a437b3.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/e64ff4da522715a17a5d996b66a62345.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/e64ff4da522715a17a5d996b66a62345.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of Tabletop Role-Playing Games, Point &amp; Click Adventures and mystery games with narrative choices and world exploration. Solve puzzles, and uncover secrets hidden around every corner, using tools both mundane and cosmic: such as a shovel, rope, or time and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5a6ce539da306d35a6920ae90d0c5859.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5a6ce539da306d35a6920ae90d0c5859.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5a6ce539da306d35a6920ae90d0c5859.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/e7427c6350dcd02be72ea8b7b831fc3f.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/e7427c6350dcd02be72ea8b7b831fc3f.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you’ll meet complex characters and delve into difficult topics and taboos. Make friends, learn their desires, and then… lie, manipulate, cheat, commit depraved acts; become what you hate; or fight against your nature. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8f097f1c0bbfc3e8dd605f8716aa3bb5.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/8f097f1c0bbfc3e8dd605f8716aa3bb5.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a richly detailed, one-of-a-kind fictional world inspired by the mythical Middle East, set at the turn of the 16th century, where exotic fantasy and harsh reality meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the esoteric lore of the world as you explore an island colony shrouded by a deadly fog of dreams, half-truths and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/eadaa3a76daa3d162b4a3dc5249af474.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/eadaa3a76daa3d162b4a3dc5249af474.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique narrative dynamic: guide a character who can argue, rebel, or deceive you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed, mythic world inspired by the Middle East at the dawn of the 16th century. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted art, evocative voice acting, and a haunting original soundtrack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experimental Heart System, where emotion and awareness change your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No failures, only consequences. Even death can lead to new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story spanning the entire spectrum of human emotion; trivial, humorous, disgusting, grotesque, and tragic. All at once.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where Birds Sleep is a story of paranoia, cruelty and manipulation that asks: where does evil come from?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/fd74bfe79d4e124da76d5b34372feb5e.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/fd74bfe79d4e124da76d5b34372feb5e.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Quiet Little Feet, a husband-and-wife team who are fascinated by player-driven narratives and the consequences powerful choices and stories can have on people. Our goal is to revolutionise video-game storytelling by bringing player agency into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/419395e5df0b614a9a781111cf383fa0.avif?t=1782342496\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/ee39763d363d114f73e61681991ceb67.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/ee39763d363d114f73e61681991ceb67.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mysterious narrative adventure about identity, manipulation and doubt. Inhabit the mind of Cormo; a villainous, selfish pirate, as he takes on a secret mission within a prison island. See the world through the eyes of a mentally and morally unstable person. Manipulate him into doing your bidding, break him and override his will, or cooperate and work as a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring real, human talent: multi-award-winning and BAFTA-nominated actor <u>Neil Newbon</u> as Cormo, along with <u>Frankie Taylor Scott</u> and <u>Ben Ayers</u>, who lend their talent and passion to the project.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/2498d74086ff95ce53339ba624a3c55b.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/ed149737f88dda69a9a6eab051bb9d8e.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/ed149737f88dda69a9a6eab051bb9d8e.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip into the mind of Cormo, a rotten man driven by greed. Cormo is his own man - he’ll argue, resist and act in ways you never intended. You’re not playing as him… you’re inside his head, struggling for control. Every choice leaves a mark on his psyche. Will you guide, manipulate, tempt or break him? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted 