ture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/5ca9ee4ec6b67bf4e377881921c9d9c6.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/8f097f1c0bbfc3e8dd605f8716aa3bb5.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/8f097f1c0bbfc3e8dd605f8716aa3bb5.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a richly detailed, one-of-a-kind fictional world inspired by the mythical Middle East, set at the turn of the 16th century, where exotic fantasy and harsh reality meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the esoteric lore of the world as you explore an island colony shrouded by a deadly fog of dreams, half-truths and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.poster.avif?t=1782342496\" width=1070 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.webm?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/c4acec0cb61d25e0c32bdc9e7a29964b.mp4?t=1782342496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/eadaa3a76daa3d162b4a3dc5249af474.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/eadaa3a76daa3d162b4a3dc5249af474.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique narrative dynamic: guide a character who can argue, rebel, or deceive you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richly detailed, mythic world inspired by the Middle East at the dawn of the 16th century. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted art, evocative voice acting, and a haunting original soundtrack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experimental Heart System, where emotion and awareness change your story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No failures, only consequences. Even death can lead to new paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story spanning the entire spectrum of human emotion; trivial, humorous, disgusting, grotesque, and tragic. All at once.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Where Birds Sleep is a story of paranoia, cruelty and manipulation that asks: where does evil come from?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/fd74bfe79d4e124da76d5b34372feb5e.avif?t=1782342496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras_big/fd74bfe79d4e124da76d5b34372feb5e.webp?t=1782342496 width=1560 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are Quiet Little Feet, a husband-and-wife team who are fascinated by player-driven narratives and the consequences powerful choices and stories can have on people. Our goal is to revolutionise video-game storytelling by bringing player agency into the narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/extras/419395e5df0b614a9a781111cf383fa0.avif?t=1782342496\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Don't control. Influence. Shape Cormo's mind with every choice as he embarks on a gruelling mission to chart a mysterious island shrouded in mind-bending fog. Put your persuasion skills to the test and direct his fate with every word, but beware; he can reject your choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/eed4f0f65a13b869b5f2fb1d36887df3e7e1178d/header.jpg?t=1782342496", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/9cf423e40d4c458dc933f152ea6057cf869304ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782342496", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1387640/9cf423e40d4c458dc933f152ea6057cf869304ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782342496", "website": "https://www.wherebirdsgotosleep.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GTX+ (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> n/a<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16: